From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: momokind <momokind2002@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:05:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [VideoPlayer] Add optional static HDR10 to Dolby Vision Profile 8.1 conversion

Add an opt-in setting (videoplayer.dolbyvisionfromhdr10, default off) to
promote static 10-bit PQ BT.2020 (HDR10) HEVC streams without native DV,
HDR Vivid, or HDR10+ metadata to Dolby Vision Profile 8.1 using static
AVMasteringDisplayMetadata and AVContentLightMetadata (MaxCLL/MaxFALL) for
L1/L6 metadata. This enables both TV-led DV output for static HDR10 and
unified pi-dv-engine HDR10 -> SDR/WCG-SDR BT.2390 tone mapping.
---
